	   $$ (1)\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\, |\varepsilon| = \frac{|n^2d-m^2|}{\varepsilon+2m} \geq \frac{|n^2d-
		m^2|}{2m+\frac{1}{2}} $$  	
	Denote  $k=n^2d-m^2,\, |k|\geq 1$ . Thus,  $(1)$  can be continued as:
